    .......................................................................|......................................................................
        Title                : platform:DescriptionType  [0..1]            | title for reporting
        Due                  : DateTimeType              [0..1]            | when an issue or reply is due
        AssignedTo           : ParticipantRefType        [0..*]            | who is managing an issue ore authoring a reply
        DependsOn            : RFILineRefType            [0..*]            | sub-issue or sub-reply
        DescriptionAttachment: platform:AttachmentType   [0..*]            | issue or reply as an attachment
        Stage                : WorkflowStageType         [0..*]            | processing stage for this issue or reply such as Started or Complete
        IssuedBy             : ParticipantRefType        [0..1]            | who issued the line item
        IssuedOn             : DateTimeType              [0..1]            | when the issue or reply was issued
        CreatedBy            : ParticipantRefType        [0..1]            | who created the record for this issue or reply
        CreatedOn            : DateTimeType              [0..1]            | when this issue or reply was added to the RFI
        ElapsedTime          : WorkflowElapsedTimeType   [0..1]            | elapsed time in the workflow
        ImportanceCode       : RFIImportanceCodeType     [0..1]            | importance of the RFI such as Medium or High
        DisciplineCode       : DisciplineCodeType        [0..*]            | discipline addressed such as architectural
        CategoryCode         : RFICategoryCodeType       [0..*]            | category for RFI such as TODO
